WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.128
Good afternoon, my followers.

2
00:00:02.212 --> 00:00:03.763
I'm Esvarena de Sousa,

3
00:00:03.847 --> 00:00:06.912
vice-president of Penajóia's
Residents' Association.

4
00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:14.658
Penajóia is land owned by the IHRU
(state housing), where we built our homes.

5
00:00:14.742 --> 00:00:17.260
Why did we build our houses
in this neighbourhood?

6
00:00:17.344 --> 00:00:20.116
Because of the housing
crisis here in Portugal.

7
00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:24.166
There is a housing crisis here
in Portugal, for those who don't know.

8
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:30.450
People often say we invaded,
did this and that, but in fact,

9
00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.632
you don't know what's going on.

10
00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:38.196
We were forced to build our houses here
because there's no housing,

11
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:44.480
as such, in Portugal.
We've been fighting the fight for housing.

12
00:00:44.564 --> 00:00:50.884
We've been seeking an agreement
from the State itself, from the IHRU,

13
00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:53.139
which owns the land.

14
00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.512
We've petitioned the City Council,
we've sent many petitions to the IHRU,

15
00:01:00.723 --> 00:01:04.354
we've sent many petitions to the State,

16
00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:08.682
to see if they'll bring water
and electricity here for us to pay for.

17
00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:14.358
We even want to pay property tax,
but neither the IHRU

18
00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:20.820
nor the City Council take responsibility.

19
00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:28.612
And we have no housing alternative,
because this

20
00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:36.117
really is a situation
the Portuguese State itself is facing.

21
00:01:36.201 --> 00:01:41.500
"Oh, you left your countries
and came here to build shacks."

22
00:01:41.584 --> 00:01:45.176
We weren't the ones
who created the shacks.

23
00:01:45.427 --> 00:01:52.762
Shacks have always existed in Portugal.
Every day that goes by,

24
00:01:53.953 --> 00:01:56.305
more neighbourhoods spring up.

25
00:01:56.816 --> 00:02:01.190
We've been fighting,
even without the State's support,

26
00:02:01.861 --> 00:02:09.730
to improve our habitat,
our plots, our homes,

27
00:02:10.929 --> 00:02:12.200
to get proper conditions.

28
00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:18.523
But it's the State's own responsibility,
it's not up to us:

29
00:02:18.714 --> 00:02:24.613
electricity, water and sanitation.

30
00:02:24.697 --> 00:02:31.530
That's something the State
itself has to provide here.

31
00:02:31.665 --> 00:02:38.122
As you can see,
the documents we sent to the City Council,

32
00:02:39.213 --> 00:02:44.350
to see if they could give us,
or supply us,

33
00:02:44.979 --> 00:02:49.560
let us benefit from these basic,
much-needed services.

34
00:02:49.644 --> 00:02:53.424
Because it's also a form
of violence, isn't it?

35
00:02:53.508 --> 00:02:55.380
It's violence against us.

36
00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:02.462
We live like this, with no water,
no electricity, no basic sanitation.

37
00:03:02.907 --> 00:03:03.669
This can't go on.

38
00:03:03.753 --> 00:03:08.324
That's why I'm making this video,
to explain it to you.

39
00:03:08.697 --> 00:03:12.226
To the many who keep saying
we want to live off handouts...

40
00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:15.227
We want to live,
to build... We want handouts?

41
00:03:15.311 --> 00:03:19.076
Nobody wants to live off handouts.
If we wanted handouts,

42
00:03:20.179 --> 00:03:24.870
we'd be staying in shelters, wouldn't we?

43
00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:29.342
We'd be staying in SOS homes.

44
00:03:29.426 --> 00:03:35.837
Every month we try to improve the
conditions of the neighbourhood itself.

45
00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:42.670
Since the State can't
build homes for everyone,

46
00:03:43.129 --> 00:03:48.470
we build our own homes,
we spend money. So,

47
00:03:48.881 --> 00:03:56.733
I think it would be common sense for the
State to bring water and electricity here.

48
00:03:57.203 --> 00:04:00.274
So, we'll keep on fighting.

49
00:04:00.544 --> 00:04:08.477
You'll be able to see the request
and also the City Council's reply.

50
00:04:08.561 --> 00:04:11.464
Because the City Council
and the IHRU keep passing the buck.

51
00:04:11.548 --> 00:04:16.650
Nobody takes responsibility. That's it.
